WEB SOURCE (THE specification) — what was reproduced
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
withAiFeature('vampire-drain-explanation', InnerSection)  → off-mode renders null (ADR-015 I5/I6).
InnerSection({ vehicleId?, lookbackDays? }):
  - useAiStream({ url: '/ai/charging/vampire-drain/explain', body, onEvent: ()=>{} })
  - numericVehicleId = typeof vehicleId === 'number' ? vehicleId : Number(vehicleId)
  - body = { vehicle_id: Number.isFinite(numericVehicleId) ? numericVehicleId : 0 }
           + lookback_days ONLY when (typeof lookbackDays === 'number' && isFinite && > 0)
  - haveInputs (canStart) = Number.isFinite(numericVehicleId) && numericVehicleId > 0
  - <AIFeatureCard title/description/buttonLabel/badgeLabel canStart={haveInputs} stream={stream} />
Data sources: useTranslation, useAiStream.   Charts/maps: none.
i18n keys extracted + reproduced (all resolve through the P1/S10 facade — no English literals in code):
  vampireDrain.aiNarrative.title        = "Explain the recent vampire drain"
  vampireDrain.aiNarrative.description  = "Ask Helix to explain the deterministic vampire-drain
                                           signal — … correlational nature honestly."
  vampireDrain.aiNarrative.generateButton = "Narrate drain"
  vampireDrain.aiNarrative.badge          = "Helix"

